<BaseLayout title="About Trade Avata — Trade Simple." description="Trade Avata is building products, technology, tools, applications and education that make trading simpler.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">About Trade Avata</span><h1>Trade Simple.</h1><p>Trade Avata is a company focused on making trading simpler through practical products, technology, applications, tools, resources and education.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container narrow-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Our purpose</span><h2>Complexity behind the scenes. Simplicity for the user.</h2><p>We are building Trade Avata as a flexible company platform rather than a single-purpose trading school or a single-product business. That foundation can support new applications, software, tools, education, digital products and other solutions as the company grows.</p><p>Whether someone is learning to trade or already has years of market experience, the goal remains the same: provide useful tools and technology that remove unnecessary complexity from the trading workflow.</p></div></section>
